                                "sense_id": "abfcf83b-d77b-3c46-8d32-85e577dd0687",
                                "text": "Since the day after the 2018 midterm elections, President Donald Trump has spent around 60% of his scheduled time in unstructured “executive time,” Axios reported Sunday."
